#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"This skill intentionally does not vendor a separate CLI implementation "
"into Hermes. Install and use upstream `x-cli` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:30
msgid "Important Cost / Access Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:32
msgid ""
"X API access is not meaningfully free for most real usage. Expect to need"
" paid or prepaid X developer access. If commands fail with permissions or"
" quota errors, check your X developer plan first."
msgstr ""

