#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:56
msgid "You need these five values from the X Developer Portal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:57
msgid "`X_API_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:58
msgid "`X_API_SECRET`"
