#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:189
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:191
msgid ""
"**Paid API access**: many failures are plan/permission problems, not code"
" problems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:192
msgid ""
"**403 oauth1-permissions**: regenerate the access token after enabling "
"`Read and write`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:193
msgid ""
"**Reply restrictions**: X restricts many programmatic replies. `tweet "
"quote` is often more reliable than `tweet reply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:194
msgid "**Rate limits**: expect per-endpoint limits and cooldown windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xitter_SKILL.md:195
msgid ""
"**Credential drift**: if you rotate tokens in `~/.env`, make sure "
"`~/.config/x-cli/.env` still points at the current file."
msgstr ""

